---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  description="The basic terms for using the WitLabs website and starting a project with us."
  canonical="https://witlabs.in/terms-and-conditions/"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-20">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <p class="text-body-sm text-muted">Last updated: May 24, 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">Website use</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        This website is provided for general information about WitLabs, our services, and our work. You agree not to use
        the site in a way that disrupts its operation or attempts to access systems without permission.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">Project inquiries</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        Submitting a form, email, call, or WhatsApp message does not create a client relationship by itself. Project scope,
        timelines, fees, and deliverables are confirmed separately in writing.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">Content and intellectual property</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        Website text, design, graphics, and other materials belong to WitLabs or their respective owners. You may not copy,
        reuse, or redistribute them without written permission.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">External links</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        This website may link to third-party platforms such as WhatsApp, social networks, payment tools, or form services.
        WitLabs is not responsible for those external services or their policies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        We aim to keep information accurate and the website available, but we do not guarantee that the site will always be
        error-free or uninterrupted.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@witlabs.in">hello@witlabs.in</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
